# WHATSAPP BUSINESS CLOUD API
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=""
WHATSAPP_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID=""
# Must be an approved marketing template with three text body parameters:
# campaign title, location, and campaign description/link.
